WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.326 --> 00:00:06.429
JUAN WILLIAMS, DANA PERINO.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:08.531
"THE FIVE" ."

00:00:08.532 --> 00:00:11.167
THIS IS VIDEO OF GEORGE HERBERT

00:00:11.168 --> 00:00:12.635
WALKER BUSH WHEN HE CRASHED INTO

00:00:12.636 --> 00:00:15.938
THE SEA AS A YOUNG PILOT.

00:00:15.939 --> 00:00:16.572
IT'S WHAT WE CALL A HERO.

00:00:16.573 --> 00:00:20.943
IF YOU ARE YOUNG PLAYING

00:00:20.944 --> 00:00:22.111
VIDEO GAMES, SHOPPING ONLINE OR

00:00:22.112 --> 00:00:23.713
FULMINATING ON FACEBOOK, IT'S

00:00:23.714 --> 00:00:24.480
BECAUSE OF SOMETHING CALLED

00:00:24.481 --> 00:00:26.349
LEISURE TIME AND LEISURE TIME

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.283
WAS BROUGHT TO YOU BY MILLIONS

00:00:27.284 --> 00:00:28.284
OF MEN AND WOMEN WHOSE BRAVERY

00:00:28.285 --> 00:00:33.356
IN TIMES OF WAR MADE OUR IDLE

00:00:33.357 --> 00:00:33.856
ACTIVITY POSSIBLE.

00:00:33.857 --> 00:00:34.590
I WONDER, WOULD WE EVEN BE HERE

00:00:34.591 --> 00:00:41.797
IF IT WEREN'T FOR MEN LIKE HIM?

00:00:41.798 --> 00:00:42.498
THE PASSING OF GEORGE HERBERT

00:00:42.499 --> 00:00:43.199
WALKER BUSH REMINDS ME OF THE

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:49.005
RECENT PASSING OF JOHN McCAIN.

00:00:49.006 --> 00:00:51.974
MEN AND WOMEN UNIFIES PEOPLE.

00:00:51.975 --> 00:00:55.545
WE TRY TO FORGET ABOUT THE OTHER

00:00:55.546 --> 00:00:56.145
STUFF WHEN REALIZE IT'S

00:00:56.146 --> 00:00:56.512
POINTLESS.

00:00:56.513 --> 00:00:57.246
PEOPLE COME AND GO ON THE PLANET

00:00:57.247 --> 00:00:57.947
AND IN OUR LIVES IT HELPS TO

00:00:57.948 --> 00:00:58.648
REMEMBER THAT ALL OF US HAVE

00:00:58.649 --> 00:01:00.516
SOMETHING IN COMMON WITH THE

00:01:00.517 --> 00:01:00.917
GREAT ONES.

00:01:00.918 --> 00:01:04.520
WITH THE EXCEPTION OF A FEW

00:01:04.521 --> 00:01:05.955
CHUCKLE BUCKETS WHO USE EVENTS

00:01:05.956 --> 00:01:07.557
TO SCORE POLITICAL POINTS, IT'S

00:01:07.558 --> 00:01:09.458
A SHARE LOSS THAT REVEALS HOW WE

00:01:09.459 --> 00:01:09.959
REALLY ARE.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:12.328
NONE OF US TWEETS IN THE FACE OF

00:01:12.329 --> 00:01:13.162
DEATH.

00:01:13.163 --> 00:01:19.335
KIND    KINDER AND GENTLER.

00:01:19.336 --> 00:01:26.542
A GREAT PERSON DIES WE CAN

00:01:26.543 --> 00:01:27.343
PARTICIPATE IN THE RITUALS.

00:01:27.344 --> 00:01:29.145
IT'S NOT A BAD THING TO USE THE

00:01:29.146 --> 00:01:32.114
PASSING OF A GREAT MAN HAS AN

00:01:32.115 --> 00:01:34.317
EXCUSE TO MAKE LIFE BETTER.

00:01:34.318 --> 00:01:35.418
LESS FINGER-POINTING.

00:01:35.419 --> 00:01:35.918
MORE HANDSHAKES.

00:01:35.919 --> 00:01:37.320
I'M SURE WE'LL GET TO OUR TRIBES

00:01:37.321 --> 00:01:40.222
BUT FOR NOW LET'S DO THE GUY A

00:01:40.223 --> 00:01:40.523
FAVOR.

00:01:40.524 --> 00:01:43.459
BE KIND AND GENTLE IN CASE HE IS

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:44.193
WATCHING.

00:01:44.194 --> 00:01:47.196
DANA, I AM SITTING IN YOUR CHAIR

00:01:47.197 --> 00:01:48.698
WHICH I FEEL QUITE STRANGE.

00:01:48.699 --> 00:01:51.567
&gt;&gt; Jesse: SO DO I.

00:01:51.568 --> 00:01:53.603
&gt;&gt; Greg: I DON'T LIKE BEING

00:01:53.604 --> 00:01:54.704
THIS CLOSE TO JESSE.

00:01:54.705 --> 00:01:58.407
&gt;&gt; Jesse: TOPPED        STOP TOU

00:01:58.408 --> 00:01:58.441
&gt;&gt; Jesse: TOPPED        STOP TOH

00:01:58.442 --> 00:01:58.474
&gt;&gt; Jesse: TOPPED        STOP TON

00:01:58.475 --> 00:01:58.708
&gt;&gt; Jesse: TOPPED        STOP TOG

00:01:58.709 --> 00:01:58.741
&gt;&gt; Jesse: TOPPED        STOP TOM

00:01:58.742 --> 00:01:59.675
&gt;&gt; Jesse: TOPPED        STOP TOE

00:01:59.676 --> 00:02:00.343
UNDER THE TABLE.

00:02:00.344 --> 00:02:02.345
&gt;&gt; Greg: THE IRREVERENCE

00:02:02.346 --> 00:02:02.878
LASTED TEN SECONDS.

00:02:02.879 --> 00:02:04.113
DANA, YOU ARE IN D.C.

00:02:04.114 --> 00:02:08.317
WHAT ARE YOUR THOUGHTS?

00:02:08.318 --> 00:02:09.752
&gt;&gt; Dana: IT'S OBVIOUSLY AN

00:02:09.753 --> 00:02:11.020
HONOR TO BE HERE AND TO BE ABLE

00:02:11.021 --> 00:02:13.155
TO HAVE KNOWN THEM AND TALK

00:02:13.156 --> 00:02:14.624
ABOUT THEM.

00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:17.927
YOUR MONOLOGUE WAS SPOT ON.

00:02:17.928 --> 00:02:19.261
A COUPLE THINGS THAT TOUCHED ME

00:02:19.262 --> 00:02:20.363
TODAY.

00:02:20.364 --> 00:02:22.131
I GOT A CHANCE TO INTERVIEW

00:02:22.132 --> 00:02:24.934
VICE PRESIDENT DAN QUAYLE AND TO

00:02:24.935 --> 00:02:26.535
LOOK BACK IN 1988 WHEN HE GAVE

00:02:26.536 --> 00:02:28.571
THE CONVENTION SPEECH.

00:02:28.572 --> 00:02:31.107
OF COURSE I REMEMBER THAT TIME.

00:02:31.108 --> 00:02:33.075
I'M SURE YOU DO TOO.

00:02:33.076 --> 00:02:33.609
MAYBE JESSE DOESN'T.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:36.178
MAYBE LISA BOOTHE WASN'T PAYING

00:02:36.179 --> 00:02:37.747
ATTENTION THERE, BECAUSE SHE IS

00:02:37.748 --> 00:02:40.316
SO YOUNG AS WELL.

00:02:40.317 --> 00:02:42.518
YOU REALIZE THINGS CHANGE.

00:02:42.519 --> 00:02:43.719
PARTIES EVOLVE.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:45.321
PEOPLE HAVE A WAY OF SORT OF

00:02:45.322 --> 00:02:46.822
FORGETTING WHAT THINGS WERE LIKE

00:02:46.823 --> 00:02:47.189
BACK THEN.

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:49.325
MOMENTS LIKE THIS ALLOW YOU A

00:02:49.326 --> 00:02:50.726
CHANCE TO PAUSE.

00:02:50.727 --> 00:02:54.130
THE MOMENT THAT TOUCHED ME TODAY

00:02:54.131 --> 00:02:54.864
WAS WHEN SENATOR BOB DOLE WENT

00:02:54.865 --> 00:02:57.967
TO THE CAPITAL.

00:02:57.968 --> 00:02:59.335
HE'S 95 YEARS OLD.

00:02:59.336 --> 00:03:01.937
AS YOU SEE THERE, HE'S HELPED BY

00:03:01.938 --> 00:03:05.608
AN ASSISTANT TO STAND SO THAT HE

00:03:05.609 --> 00:03:08.944
COULD PROPERLY AND IN HIS WAY TO

00:03:08.945 --> 00:03:10.780
PAY HIS RESPECTS TO

00:03:10.781 --> 00:03:12.114
GEORGE H.W. BUSH, WHO WAS A VERY

00:03:12.115 --> 00:03:13.516
GOOD FRIEND OF HIS.

00:03:13.517 --> 00:03:15.184
OF COURSE THEY WERE COMPETITORS

00:03:15.185 --> 00:03:15.818
BUT FRIENDLY COMPETITORS.

00:03:15.819 --> 00:03:18.187
GREG, I THINK LAST WEEK WE WERE

00:03:18.188 --> 00:03:19.555
TALKING ABOUT THE GREATEST

00:03:19.556 --> 00:03:19.955
GENERATION.

00:03:19.956 --> 00:03:21.757
I'M SORRY, IT WAS ANDY

00:03:21.758 --> 00:03:22.258
FERGUSON'S PIECE.

00:03:22.259 --> 00:03:24.126
HE WAS A FRIEND OF YOURS AND A

00:03:24.127 --> 00:03:25.561
SPEECHWRITER FOR

00:03:25.562 --> 00:03:26.562
GEORGE H.W. BUSH AND HE WROTE

00:03:26.563 --> 00:03:29.932
ABOUT A SPEECH HE HAD TO GIVE IN

00:03:29.933 --> 00:03:32.334
WHICH, IN 1982 DURING HIS

00:03:32.335 --> 00:03:32.968
REELECTION, THE POLITICAL

00:03:32.969 --> 00:03:34.804
CONSULTANT SAID DON'T TALK ABOUT

00:03:34.805 --> 00:03:35.538
HIS WAR SERVICE.

00:03:35.539 --> 00:03:37.139
DON'T LET HIM TALK ABOUT HIS WAR

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:38.207
SERVICE BECAUSE IT WILL MAKE HIM

00:03:38.208 --> 00:03:41.377
LOOK TO OLD IN COMPARISON TO

00:03:41.378 --> 00:03:42.545
BILL CLINTON.

00:03:42.546 --> 00:03:44.780
THEN, FOUR WEEKS BEFORE THE

00:03:44.781 --> 00:03:45.381
ELECTION, THE POLITICAL

00:03:45.382 --> 00:03:46.348
CONSULTANTS CHANGED THEIR MIND

00:03:46.349 --> 00:03:47.283
AND SAID MAYBE WE SHOULD

00:03:47.284 --> 00:03:50.720
HIGHLIGHT HIS WAR SERVICE.

00:03:50.721 --> 00:03:51.520
HE WRITES THIS TEACHING THAT THE

00:03:51.521 --> 00:03:53.823
END OF IT, HE SAYS, IN THE

00:03:53.824 --> 00:03:56.158
ARTICLE HE WROTE, FERGUSON SAYS

00:03:56.159 --> 00:03:57.359
"NEARLY ALL OF THEM ARE GONE

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:57.993
NOW."

00:03:57.994 --> 00:03:59.729
I THINK MAYBE THAT'S WHY IT

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:01.363
FEELS VERY POIGNANT.

00:04:01.364 --> 00:04:02.531
THIS GREATEST GENERATION, WE ARE

00:04:02.532 --> 00:04:04.533
HAVING TO SAY GOODBYE TO THEM.

00:04:04.534 --> 00:04:07.136
&gt;&gt; Greg: IT'S NOT JUST

00:04:07.137 --> 00:04:08.571
MR. BUSH, IT'S WHO HE

00:04:08.572 --> 00:04:09.371
SYMBOLIZES, MILLIONS OF MEN THAT

00:04:09.372 --> 00:04:12.141
ARE NO LONGER HERE.

00:04:12.142 --> 00:04:14.376
JUAN, YOU WORKED, YOU ARE AT THE

00:04:14.377 --> 00:04:16.979
POST IN '88?

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.214
YOU PROBABLY RAN INTO

00:04:18.215 --> 00:04:19.682
PRESIDENT BUSH WHEN HE WAS

00:04:19.683 --> 00:04:20.583
PRESIDENT OR VICE PRESIDENT.

00:04:20.584 --> 00:04:21.684
&gt;&gt; Juan: HE WAS

00:04:21.685 --> 00:04:22.551
VICE PRESIDENT, THAT'S WHEN I

00:04:22.552 --> 00:04:24.587
SPEND MOST OF THE TIME WITH HIM.

00:04:24.588 --> 00:04:25.855
FLYING AROUND THE COUNTRY GOING

00:04:25.856 --> 00:04:27.490
TO REPUBLICAN EVENTS, TRYING TO

00:04:27.491 --> 00:04:28.591
GET RONALD REAGAN REELECTED.

00:04:28.592 --> 00:04:29.592
I HAD A WONDERFUL TIME.

00:04:29.593 --> 00:04:31.994
IT WAS KIND OF LIKE BEING AT THE

00:04:31.995 --> 00:04:33.596
FEET OF THE MASTER BECAUSE YOU

00:04:33.597 --> 00:04:35.965
TALK ABOUT A POLITICAL -- HE HAD

00:04:35.966 --> 00:04:36.799
BEEN HEAD OF THE REPUBLICAN

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:38.234
NATIONAL COMMITTEE IN ADDITION

00:04:38.235 --> 00:04:40.369
TO RUNNING TWICE FOR

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:41.170
SENATOR UNSUCCESSFULLY BUT THEN

00:04:41.171 --> 00:04:43.539
HOLDING A HOUSE EAT TWICE FROM

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:44.940
HOUSTON.

00:04:44.941 --> 00:04:46.375
HE HAD BEEN THROUGH A LOT

00:04:46.376 --> 00:04:47.176
POLITICALLY.

00:04:47.177 --> 00:04:48.778
HE KNEW THE POLITICAL LEADERSHIP

00:04:48.779 --> 00:04:50.246
GOING BACK TO THE GOLDWATER DAYS

00:04:50.247 --> 00:04:51.881
OF '64.

00:04:51.882 --> 00:04:54.350
YOU TALK ABOUT A REPUBLICAN

00:04:54.351 --> 00:04:56.085
PARTY EXPERT IN TERMS OF, I WAS

00:04:56.086 --> 00:04:58.120
SAYING HE'S FAMOUS FOR WRITING

00:04:58.121 --> 00:04:59.989
NOTES TO PEOPLE AND I'M SURE

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:00.556
DANA HAS A TON.

00:05:00.557 --> 00:05:01.557
I HAVE SOME.

00:05:01.558 --> 00:05:03.826
HE WOULD WRITE NOTES TO ALL THE

00:05:03.827 --> 00:05:04.627
PARTY LEADER SO THAT THEY FELT

00:05:04.628 --> 00:05:07.363
THEY HAD A PERSONAL RELATIONSHIP

00:05:07.364 --> 00:05:08.430
WITH HIM.

00:05:08.431 --> 00:05:10.399
THE AXIOM HERE WAS DON'T CALL

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:13.936
SOMEBODY UP TO ASK A FAVOR,

00:05:13.937 --> 00:05:15.771
POLITICAL FAVOR, PERSONAL FAVOR,

00:05:15.772 --> 00:05:17.339
RIGHT OUT OF THE BOX WITHOUT

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:19.375
SAYING HOW ARE YOU DOING?

00:05:19.376 --> 00:05:20.176
HOW ARE YOU?

00:05:20.177 --> 00:05:21.377
HOW ARE THE KIDS?

00:05:21.378 --> 00:05:22.778
THAT'S THE RELATIONSHIP HE HAD,

00:05:22.779 --> 00:05:24.180
SO THAT EVEN THE PEOPLE

00:05:24.181 --> 00:05:25.748
DISAGREED WITH HIM, SPECIFICALLY

00:05:25.749 --> 00:05:26.782
I WOULD GUESS IN THIS DAY HAVE

00:05:26.783 --> 00:05:28.951
TRIBES COME IF YOU SAY, GREG,

00:05:28.952 --> 00:05:30.786
THE DEMOCRATS.

00:05:30.787 --> 00:05:31.787
OH, MY GOSH.

00:05:31.788 --> 00:05:34.023
DEMOCRATS HAD A PRETTY GOOD

00:05:34.024 --> 00:05:34.456
RELATIONSHIP.

00:05:34.457 --> 00:05:35.624
DIDN'T ALWAYS COME TO GOOD

00:05:35.625 --> 00:05:36.358
POLITICAL ENDS BECAUSE REMEMBER

00:05:36.359 --> 00:05:38.060
IN TERMS OF THE BUDGET DEAL

00:05:38.061 --> 00:05:39.094
WHERE HE ALLOWED TAXES TO BE

00:05:39.095 --> 00:05:40.830
RAISED IN ORDER TO LOWER THE

00:05:40.831 --> 00:05:42.231
DEFICIT, IT WAS HELD AGAINST HIM

00:05:42.232 --> 00:05:44.800
BY SOME IN THE PARTY, ESPECIALLY

00:05:44.801 --> 00:05:45.801
THE FAR RIGHT, THE NEWT GINGRICH

00:05:45.802 --> 00:05:47.603
TYPES WHO SAID YOU ARE BREAKING

00:05:47.604 --> 00:05:49.772
YOUR PLEDGE NOT TO RAISE TAXES.

00:05:49.773 --> 00:05:53.509
READ MY LIPS, NO NEW TAXES.

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:55.444
BUT THIS IS AN EXAMPLE, I KEEP

00:05:55.445 --> 00:05:56.946
SAYING THAT I WOULD HOLD UP TO

00:05:56.947 --> 00:05:58.147
MY CHILDREN IS THAT KIND OF

00:05:58.148 --> 00:06:01.984
PERSON THAT YOU WANT TO BE.

00:06:01.985 --> 00:06:04.019
SOMEONE WHO IS ABOUT PUBLIC

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:06.188
SERVICE, LOVE OF COUNTRY, LOVE

00:06:06.189 --> 00:06:10.392
OF FAMILY, AND TREATED PEOPLE AS

00:06:10.393 --> 00:06:15.931
INDIVIDUALS, NOT AS I AM

00:06:15.932 --> 00:06:16.432
GEORGE H.W. BUSH.

00:06:16.433 --> 00:06:17.366
WHO ARE YOU?

00:06:17.367 --> 00:06:18.667
NO, IT WAS LIKE TELL ME ABOUT

00:06:18.668 --> 00:06:18.934
YOU.

00:06:18.935 --> 00:06:21.337
&gt;&gt; Jesse: SOME PERSONAL

00:06:21.338 --> 00:06:21.971
REFLECTIONS.

00:06:21.972 --> 00:06:23.572
I CAME UP UNDER THE AGE OF BUSH,

00:06:23.573 --> 00:06:24.940
HE WAS IN THE VICE PRESIDENCY

00:06:24.941 --> 00:06:26.542
WHEN I WAS YOUNG AND THEN THE

00:06:26.543 --> 00:06:28.544
PRESIDENCY AND THAT HIS SON'S

00:06:28.545 --> 00:06:30.579
PRESIDENCY.

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:31.981
A GREAT STATESMAN IN AMERICA.

00:06:31.982 --> 00:06:35.985
JUST A FEW THINGS COME TO MIND.

00:06:35.986 --> 00:06:37.286
HUMILITY, DIGNITY, CLASS, AND

00:06:37.287 --> 00:06:38.254
LOVE.

00:06:38.255 --> 00:06:41.123
YOU TALK ABOUT HE OVERSAW

00:06:41.124 --> 00:06:42.358
AMERICA WINNING THE COLD WAR.

00:06:42.359 --> 00:06:44.126
THAT WAS A TIME WHEN HE COULD

00:06:44.127 --> 00:06:45.761
HAVE SAID AMERICA SHOULD JUST

00:06:45.762 --> 00:06:46.962
BEAT OUR CHESTS AND GLOAT AND

00:06:46.963 --> 00:06:48.564
SPIKE THE FOOTBALL.

00:06:48.565 --> 00:06:49.965
INSTEAD, HE DIDN'T.

00:06:49.966 --> 00:06:50.966
HE SAID ABSOLUTELY NOTHING.

00:06:50.967 --> 00:06:52.401
THE SILENCE WAS VERY IMPORTANT

00:06:52.402 --> 00:06:55.104
AT THAT TIME, THERE WAS A VERY

00:06:55.105 --> 00:06:55.571
POWERFUL MOMENT.

00:06:55.572 --> 00:06:58.941
I THINK HE WAS RAISED IN THE

00:06:58.942 --> 00:07:00.943
PREP SCHOOL, BOARDING SCHOOL ERA

00:07:00.944 --> 00:07:01.810
WHERE GOOD SPORTSMANSHIP IS

00:07:01.811 --> 00:07:03.545
DRILLED INTO YOU.

00:07:03.546 --> 00:07:05.881
HE ALWAYS WON WITH CLASS AND

00:07:05.882 --> 00:07:06.815
DIGNITY.

00:07:06.816 --> 00:07:09.919
ALSO WHEN HE KICKED SADDAM OUT

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:14.189
OF KUWAIT, HE HAD THE ABILITY TO

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:15.424
RUSH TO BAGHDAD AND OVERTAKE THE

00:07:15.425 --> 00:07:16.725
ENTIRE GOVERNMENT AND HE WAS

00:07:16.726 --> 00:07:17.993
HUMBLE ENOUGH TO KNOW THE

00:07:17.994 --> 00:07:19.962
LIMITATIONS OF AMERICAN MILITARY

00:07:19.963 --> 00:07:20.262
POWER.

00:07:20.263 --> 00:07:22.131
I THINK EVERYONE, REPUBLICANS

00:07:22.132 --> 00:07:23.565
AND DEMOCRATS, LOOK BACK AND SAY

00:07:23.566 --> 00:07:25.901
THAT WAS A WISE AND HUMBLE AND

00:07:25.902 --> 00:07:27.503
NOBLE DECISION.

00:07:27.504 --> 00:07:28.938
JUAN PICKED UP ON A FEW THINGS.

00:07:28.939 --> 00:07:30.172
THE PERSONAL RELATIONSHIPS HE

00:07:30.173 --> 00:07:32.942
HAD WITH PEOPLE, PROFESSIONAL

00:07:32.943 --> 00:07:34.944
RELATIONSHIPS, FRIENDSHIPS.

00:07:34.945 --> 00:07:37.346
HE REALLY CONDUCTED IN A CLASSY

00:07:37.347 --> 00:07:38.347
WAY, COMMUNICATED ON STATIONARY,

00:07:38.348 --> 00:07:39.882
PICKING UP THE PHONE.

00:07:39.883 --> 00:07:41.583
HE DID THAT FOR SO MANY DECADES

00:07:41.584 --> 00:07:45.087
THAT HE GENERATED SO MUCH

00:07:45.088 --> 00:07:45.454
GOODWILL.

00:07:45.455 --> 00:07:47.523
TOWARDS THE END MET COME THE

00:07:47.524 --> 00:07:49.525
REPUBLICAN PARTY WAS THE PARTY

00:07:49.526 --> 00:07:52.161
OF BUSH.

00:07:52.162 --> 00:07:53.963
THE ROLODEX, ALL THE PEOPLE HE

00:07:53.964 --> 00:07:55.130
KNEW, THE NETWORKS ACROSS THE

00:07:55.131 --> 00:07:57.499
ENTIRE COUNTRY, THEY HAD SO MUCH

00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:00.135
HONOR AND REVERENCE FOR HIM AND

00:08:00.136 --> 00:08:00.736
HIS FAMILY.

00:08:00.737 --> 00:08:01.537
WHEN HE CALLED AND ASKED FOR

00:08:01.538 --> 00:08:03.272
SOMETHING, IT WAS SURE, NOT A

00:08:03.273 --> 00:08:04.373
POLITICAL FAVOR.

00:08:04.374 --> 00:08:05.841
YOU ARE DOING SOMETHING FOR A

00:08:05.842 --> 00:08:06.175
FRIEND.

00:08:06.176 --> 00:08:08.577
LASTLY, LOVE.

00:08:08.578 --> 00:08:10.579
IN TERMS OF HIS RELATIONSHIP

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:12.014
WITH BARBARA AND HIS SONS

00:08:12.015 --> 00:08:15.784
PUBLICLY AT LEAST, YOU WOULD

00:08:15.785 --> 00:08:16.986
THINK A MAN OF HIS GENERATION

00:08:16.987 --> 00:08:18.754
WOULDN'T BE CONDITIONED TO SHOW

00:08:18.755 --> 00:08:20.489
THAT KIND OF AFFECTION TOWARDS

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:22.725
OTHER PEOPLE, ESPECIALLY HIS

00:08:22.726 --> 00:08:23.959
FAMILY, IN PUBLIC.

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:25.194
BUT HIS LOVE AND AFFECTION, THE

00:08:25.195 --> 00:08:27.563
WAY HE DISPLAYED IT, WAS VERY

00:08:27.564 --> 00:08:27.963
MODERN.

00:08:27.964 --> 00:08:30.766
